  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MailInbox
  sender: Project Management
  subject: Minesweeper Project - Getting Started
  body: 'Hi,


    You''re leading our new Minesweeper project, built in C++ using SFML 3.0. We''ll review the finished application at the end of the next two weeks.


    For today, get the development environment ready and confirm that you can open an SFML window. We''ll send additional requirements as the project progresses.


    Steve will be working alongside you. He''s eager to learn how you approach a project like this, so please keep him involved.


    With your experience, I''m sure we''re in good hands.


    Best,

    Project Management'
